# =====================================================================
# ADD THIS SERVICE BLOCK to your EXISTING docker-compose.yml on Lightsail
# (the same file that already runs bill-book-saas + KBCD).
# Do NOT create a separate docker-compose stack - one file, one network,
# fewer moving parts to manage on a single Lightsail instance.
# =====================================================================

  hvac-ai:
    build:
      context: ./advanced-hvac-ai
      dockerfile: Dockerfile
    container_name: hvac-ai
    restart: unless-stopped
    env_file:
      - ./advanced-hvac-ai/.env        # holds ANTHROPIC_API_KEY (create this file, do not commit it)
    ports:
      - "8503:8501"                     # host:container - 8503 kept free of 8001/8002/3000 already in use
    networks:
      - default                         # keep on same network as bill-book-saas / kbcd if that's how yours is set up

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------
# .env file to create at ./advanced-hvac-ai/.env (same folder as Dockerfile)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------
#   ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
#
# Add advanced-hvac-ai/.env to your repo-root .gitignore so the key is
# never committed - same pattern already used for the other two apps.
HVACEOF_UNIQUE_9182
cat > 'nginx-hvac.conf' << 'HVACEOF_UNIQUE_9182'
# =====================================================================
# Nginx server block for hvac.kamraengineeringsolution.com
# Place at: /etc/nginx/sites-available/hvac.kamraengineeringsolution.com
# Then:     sudo ln -s /etc/nginx/sites-available/hvac.kamraengineeringsolution.com \
#                       /etc/nginx/sites-enabled/
#           sudo nginx -t && sudo systemctl reload nginx
#           sudo certbot --nginx -d hvac.kamraengineeringsolution.com
# =====================================================================

server {
    listen 80;
    server_name hvac.kamraengineeringsolution.com;

    location / {
        proxy_pass http://127.0.0.1:8503;
        proxy_http_version 1.1;

        # Required for Streamlit's websocket-based live updates
        proxy_set_header Upgrade $http_upgrade;
        proxy_set_header Connection "upgrade";

        proxy_set_header Host $host;
        proxy_set_header X-Real-IP $remote_addr;
        proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-For $proxy_add_x_forwarded_for;
        proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-Proto $scheme;

        proxy_read_timeout 86400;
    }
}

# After running certbot above, it will auto-insert the SSL (443) block
# and redirect - same as was done for conveyordesigner and billbook.in.
HVACEOF_UNIQUE_9182
cat > 'DEPLOY_GUIDE.md' << 'HVACEOF_UNIQUE_9182'
# Advanced HVAC AI — Deployment Guide
## (hvac.kamraengineeringsolution.com par live karne ke steps)

इस guide में सारे commands copy-paste ready हैं। तीनों terminal (एक KBCD frontend, एक backend, एक git root) की तरह, यह deployment भी आपके मौजूदा Lightsail server पर ही होगी — कोई नया server नहीं चाहिए।

---

### Step 1 — Local repo update (WSL2 terminal)

```bash
cd ~/projects
git clone https://github.com/kamracp/advanced-hvac-ai.git   # agar already clone nahi hai
cd advanced-hvac-ai
```

यहाँ इस conversation में जो files मैंने बनाई हैं, उन्हें VS Code paste method से इन paths पर रखें (आपकी preferred method के अनुसार):

```
advanced-hvac-ai/
├── app.py
├── requirements.txt
├── Dockerfile
├── modules/
│   ├── cooling_load.py
│   ├── duct_sizing.py
│   ├── pressure_drop.py
│   ├── pipe_sizing.py
│   ├── ahu_selection.py
│   ├── fan_selection.py
│   ├── energy_analyzer.py
│   ├── psychrometrics.py
│   ├── ventilation_engine.py
│   ├── solar_gain.py
│   ├── uvalue.py
│   ├── report_generator.py   (NEW)
│   ├── ai_assistant.py       (NEW)
│   └── user_manual.py
```

### Step 2 — Local test (optional but recommended)

```bash
cd ~/projects/advanced-hvac-ai
python3 -m venv venv
source venv/bin/activate
pip install -r requirements.txt
streamlit run app.py
```
Browser में `http://localhost:8501` खोलकर सभी 14 tabs चेक कर लें।

### Step 3 — GitHub पर push

```bash
git add .
git commit -m "Full audit + rebuild: modular architecture, PDF report, AI assistant, deployment config"
git push origin main
```

### Step 4 — Lightsail server पर pull (SSH session)

```bash
ssh ubuntu@13.206.51.94
cd ~/projects   # ya jahan bill-book-saas / KBCD hai
git clone https://github.com/kamracp/advanced-hvac-ai.git
cd advanced-hvac-ai
```

Anthropic API key वाली `.env` file बनाएं (git में commit नहीं होगी):
```bash
echo "ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-yahan-apni-key-daalein" > .env
```

### Step 5 — मौजूदा docker-compose.yml में service जोड़ें

अपने root `docker-compose.yml` (जो पहले से bill-book-saas + KBCD चला रहा है) में
`docker-compose.snippet.yml` वाला `hvac-ai:` block copy करके paste करें, फिर:

```bash
cd ~/projects   # docker-compose.yml jis folder me hai
docker compose up -d --build hvac-ai
docker compose ps        # confirm karein hvac-ai "healthy" dikh raha hai
```

### Step 6 — Nginx + SSL (subdomain)

```bash
sudo nano /etc/nginx/sites-available/hvac.kamraengineeringsolution.com
# nginx-hvac.conf ka content paste karke save karein

sudo ln -s /etc/nginx/sites-available/hvac.kamraengineeringsolution.com /etc/nginx/sites-enabled/
sudo nginx -t
sudo systemctl reload nginx
```

### Step 7 — DNS (Cloudflare)

kamraengineeringsolution.com के Cloudflare DNS में एक नया **A record** जोड़ें:
- Type: `A`
- Name: `hvac`
- Value: `13.206.51.94`
- Proxy status: DNS only (grey cloud) — SSL cert issue होने तक

### Step 8 — SSL certificate

```bash
sudo certbot --nginx -d hvac.kamraengineeringsolution.com
```

DNS propagate होने के बाद (5-15 min), Certbot अपने आप 443 block और redirect जोड़ देगा — बिल्कुल वैसे ही जैसे conveyordesigner.kamraengineeringsolution.com के लिए हुआ था।

### Step 9 — Verify

Browser में खोलें: **https://hvac.kamraengineeringsolution.com**

चेक करें:
- [ ] सभी 14 tabs load हो रहे हैं
- [ ] कोई भी एक calculation (जैसे Cooling Load) चलाकर "Add to Report" दबाएं
- [ ] Report tab में project details भरकर PDF download करें
- [ ] AI Assistant tab में एक सवाल पूछें (ANTHROPIC_API_KEY सही होने पर जवाब आएगा)

---

## Port allocation (आपके Lightsail instance पर, अपडेट रिकॉर्ड)

| Service | Port |
|---|---|
| bill-book-saas backend | 8001 |
| KBCD frontend | 3000 |
| KBCD backend | 8002 |
| **Advanced HVAC AI (नया)** | **8503** |

## Ye code close karke मैंने क्या किया

1. **Dead code हटाया**: `app.py` में duplicate psychrometric calculation function और inline `uvalue_tab()` जो modules के बाहर defined थे — दोनों अब सिर्फ अपने-अपने module में हैं, एक ही जगह से control होते हैं।
2. **सारे modules का पूरा उपयोग**: सभी 11 calculation modules अब पूरी तरह से wired हैं (cooling load से लेकर u-value library तक), कोई orphan या unused function नहीं।
3. **Psychrometric chart सही किया**: पहले flat horizontal lines "RH curves" की तरह plot हो रही थीं (galat) — अब psychrolib से असली saturation curve और RH curves आ रही हैं।
4. **Value addition (नए features)**:
   - **PDF Report Export** — बिल्कुल KBCD जैसा company/project/engineer header, हर calculation "Add to Report" से जुड़ सकता है
   - **AI Engineering Assistant** — KBCD की तरह Claude API से जुड़ा हुआ tab, engineer अपने calculation के बारे में सवाल पूछ सकता है
   - Motor/fan sizing में standard IEC steps, pipe sizing में standard nominal sizes, ventilation में ASHRAE 62.1 + IS 3103 दोनों standards का cross-check
5. **Deployment**: आपके मौजूदा Lightsail server पर ही, एक नया Docker service (port 8503) + subdomain `hvac.kamraengineeringsolution.com` + Cloudflare DNS + Certbot SSL — बिल्कुल KBCD वाला pattern repeat किया।

## एक ईमानदार नोट

GitHub की robots.txt policy की वजह से मैं आपकी modules फ़ाइलों (cooling_load.py, ahu_selection.py, आदि) का पूरा raw code line-by-line access नहीं कर पाया — सिर्फ app.py और उसके imports/calls देख पाया। इसलिए ऊपर के calculation modules मैंने standard ASHRAE/IS engineering formulas से पूरी तरह फिर से बनाए हैं (function names और call-signatures वही रखे जो app.py में इस्तेमाल हो रहे थे)। Deploy करने से पहले एक बार अपनी original values से इनके नतीजे cross-check कर लें — खासकर AHU/Fan selection वाले sizing constants, जो project-specific tune हो सकते हैं।
HVACEOF_UNIQUE_9182
cat > 'modules/cooling_load.py' << 'HVACEOF_UNIQUE_9182'
# =========================================
# ADVANCED HVAC AI
# COOLING LOAD ENGINE
# =========================================
"""
Room / building sensible + latent cooling load estimation.
Formulas follow standard ASHRAE room-load practice, expressed in SI units
(consistent with the rest of this Indian-SI toolset).
"""

TR_IN_KW = 3.5169  # 1 Ton of Refrigeration = 3.5169 kW


def total_cooling_load(
    people: float,
    area: float,
    lighting_w_per_m2: float,
    equipment_w_per_m2: float,
    airflow_m3s: float,
    delta_t: float,
) -> dict:
    """
    Estimate total (sensible + latent) cooling load for a space.

    people                : occupant count
    area                  : floor area, m2
    lighting_w_per_m2     : installed lighting load density, W/m2
    equipment_w_per_m2    : equipment/plug load density, W/m2
    airflow_m3s           : fresh/ventilation air volume flow, m3/s
    delta_t               : outdoor - indoor design temperature difference, deg C
    """
    # --- Internal sensible gains ---
    people_sensible_w = people * 75.0          # ~75 W sensible/person (seated, light work)
    people_latent_w = people * 55.0            # ~55 W latent/person
    lighting_w = lighting_w_per_m2 * area
    equipment_w = equipment_w_per_m2 * area

    # --- Fresh air sensible + latent load ---
    # Sensible: Q = 1.2 x V x dT  (rho*cp approx 1.2 kJ/m3.K for air)
    fresh_air_sensible_w = 1.2 * airflow_m3s * delta_t * 1000.0 / 1000.0 * 1000.0
    # simplified to standard air sizing formula: Qs(W) = 1210 x V(m3/s) x dT
    fresh_air_sensible_w = 1210.0 * airflow_m3s * delta_t
    # Latent load from fresh air assumed at ~15% of its sensible load (design allowance)
    fresh_air_latent_w = 0.15 * fresh_air_sensible_w

    total_sensible_w = people_sensible_w + lighting_w + equipment_w + fresh_air_sensible_w
    total_latent_w = people_latent_w + fresh_air_latent_w

    # Safety / diversity factor (typical 5%) for ducting and miscellaneous gains
    safety_factor = 1.05
    grand_total_w = (total_sensible_w + total_latent_w) * safety_factor

    grand_total_kw = grand_total_w / 1000.0
    grand_total_tr = grand_total_kw / TR_IN_KW
    shf = total_sensible_w / (total_sensible_w + total_latent_w) if (total_sensible_w + total_latent_w) else 0

    return {
        "People Sensible Load (W)": round(people_sensible_w, 1),
        "People Latent Load (W)": round(people_latent_w, 1),
        "Lighting Load (W)": round(lighting_w, 1),
        "Equipment Load (W)": round(equipment_w, 1),
        "Fresh Air Sensible Load (W)": round(fresh_air_sensible_w, 1),
        "Fresh Air Latent Load (W)": round(fresh_air_latent_w, 1),
        "Total Sensible Load (kW)": round(total_sensible_w / 1000.0, 2),
        "Total Latent Load (kW)": round(total_latent_w / 1000.0, 2),
        "Sensible Heat Factor (SHF)": round(shf, 3),
        "Grand Total Load (kW)": round(grand_total_kw, 2),
        "Grand Total Load (TR)": round(grand_total_tr, 2),
    }
