# =========================================
# ADVANCED HVAC AI
# USER MANUAL
# =========================================
import streamlit as st


def show_user_manual():
    st.header("User Manual")
    st.markdown("---")

    st.markdown(
        """
### Kamra Advanced HVAC AI — Engineering Reference Tool

This tool provides quick, standards-referenced sizing calculations for
common HVAC engineering tasks. It is intended as a preliminary design
and cross-check aid — always verify against project-specific design
conditions and applicable codes before finalising equipment selection.

**Modules available:**

| Tab | Purpose | Reference |
|---|---|---|
| Cooling Load | Room sensible + latent load estimate | ASHRAE room-load method |
| Duct Sizing | Rectangular / circular duct sizing | Equal-velocity method, SMACNA equivalent diameter |
| Pressure Drop | Duct system static pressure loss | Darcy friction + fitting equivalent length |
| Psychrometrics | Air-state properties + chart | ASHRAE psychrometrics (psychrolib) |
| Pipe Sizing | Chilled/hot water pipe sizing | Standard nominal pipe sizes |
| AHU Selection | Coil, filter, fan/motor sizing | Typical Indian AHU design practice |
| Fan Selection | Fan shaft power + motor rating | Fan air-power method |
| Energy Analyzer | Annual energy + running cost | Plant kW/TR method, CEA grid emission factor |
| ASHRAE Ventilation | Fresh-air requirement | ASHRAE 62.1 + IS 3103 cross-check |
| Solar Gain | Fenestration solar heat gain | Peak-solar / shading-coefficient method |
| U-Value Library | Envelope heat gain by construction type | Q = U x A x dT |
| AI Engineering Assistant | Ask a design question about your results | Claude AI |

**Report Export:** Every calculation tab can be added to the session
report and exported as a branded PDF with your company / engineer /
project details from the **Report** tab.

**Disclaimer:** Outputs are for preliminary sizing and engineering
judgement support. Final design must be verified by a qualified HVAC
engineer against project-specific conditions, manufacturer selection
software, and applicable statutory codes (NBC India, ASHRAE, IS
standards as relevant).
        """
    )
